OL,3,GNEWSAHarbour trade slowly returns after
OL,4,Ablaze disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarbour businesses in Kent have seen
OL,7,Ftrade tentatively return after
OL,8,Fdisruption caused by a fire at a nearby
OL,9,Fhotel last weekend.
OL,11,FA fire broke out at the Grand Burstin
OL,12,FHotel in Folkestone in the early hours
OL,13,Fof Saturday, with 280 people evacuated
OL,14,Ffrom the building.
OL,16,FFolkestone & Hythe District Council
OL,17,Fleader Jim Martin said engineers were
OL,18,Fstill investigating the building's
OL,19,Fstructure after the "very intense and
OL,20,Fserious" blaze.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
