OL,3,GNEWSAHarbour trade slowly returns after
OL,4,Ablaze disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FMurat Karakartal, owner of Harbour Fish
OL,7,FBar, said his business was badly
OL,8,Faffected by the absence of hotel
OL,9,Fguests, but he was "very appreciative"
OL,10,Fof locals who had visited in recent
OL,11,Fdays.
